@@ -5,6 +5,12 @@
 
 ## 2026-08-30
 
+### Shared-runtime Story landing gates recovered (TASK-260830-1x524u)
+
+- INTEGRITY: The five Shared Runtime Story checkpoint commits were re-materialized with valid configured-human signatures and monotonic Asia/Tbilisi timestamps. Local and remote `task-board/story/STORY-260715-1y04r0` now match at `9bf4d0892db03035b989a4c040cfee37636ff8df`; all prior Story children and the direct packet-bridge, SSH-engine, and generated-project architecture blockers are terminal.
+- LANDING GATES: The candidate preserves the existing serial Codex/Sol high spawn policy and adds the fail-closed `make credential-free-validate` Story integration suite. The owning Epic dependency was narrowed to the accepted macOS architecture verification, and authoritative board validation is clean before final-candidate publication.
+- BOUNDARY: Revalidation changes no runtime behavior and does not add live provider wiring. The generated macOS `PacketTunnelProvider` remains a lifecycle shell; validation is limited to deterministic harnesses, compile/build gates, documentation, and read-only system-state observations, with no provider launch, VPN activation, route mutation, or DNS mutation.
+
 ### Accepted M0 production bindings (TASK-260720-1qhxqa)
 
 - DECISION: Bound the exact reviewer-accepted generated-project, packet/HEV, and SSH outcome/verdict resource pairs plus the accepted M1 runtime contract in `Configuration/TASK-260720-1qhxqa_m0-production-bindings-v1.json`. Acceptance timestamps preserve upstream date precision instead of inventing a time of day.
